{
  "uid": "secmetrics-overview",
  "title": "secMetrics — Security Overview",
  "description": "Postur keamanan gabungan dari seluruh security scanner. Setiap panel punya deskripsi; arahkan kursor ke ikon (i) di pojok panel untuk membaca alasan pemilihan metrik dan query-nya.",
  "tags": ["security", "devsecops"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": { "from": "now-3h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "project",
        "label": "Project",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "secmetrics-prometheus" },
        "query": "label_values(secmetrics_scan_success, project)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "tool",
        "label": "Tool",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "secmetrics-prometheus" },
        "query": "label_values(secmetrics_scan_success, tool)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Critical",
      "description": "Jumlah temuan critical dari seluruh tool.\n\nPromQL: sum(secmetrics_vulnerabilities{severity=\"critical\"})\n\nAngka ini yang menentukan apakah rilis boleh jalan atau tidak. Nilai > 0 langsung berwarna merah — tidak ada zona 'agak aman' untuk critical.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "secmetrics-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(secmetrics_vulnerabilities{severity=\"critical\", project=~\"$project\", tool=~\"$tool\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "dark-red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "High",
      "description": "PromQL: sum(secmetrics_vulnerabilities{severity=\"high\"})\n\nAmbang batasnya lebih longgar dari critical: beberapa temuan high biasanya dapat ditoleransi sementara, tapi lebih dari 20 menandakan base image atau dependency yang sudah terlalu tertinggal.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "secmetrics-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(secmetrics_vulnerabilities{severity=\"high\", project=~\"$project\", tool=~\"$tool\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 20 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Medium",
      "description": "PromQL: sum(secmetrics_vulnerabilities{severity=\"medium\"})\n\nDitampilkan sebagai konteks, bukan pemicu tindakan. Warnanya sengaja netral supaya tidak bersaing memperebutkan perhatian dengan critical/high.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "secmetrics-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(secmetrics_vulnerabilities{severity=\"medium\", project=~\"$project\", tool=~\"$tool\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "yellow" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "yellow", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Low",
      "description": "PromQL: sum(secmetrics_vulnerabilities{severity=\"low\"})",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "secmetrics-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(secmetrics_vulnerabilities{severity=\"low\", project=~\"$project\", tool=~\"$tool\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "text", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Skor Risiko",
      "description": "PromQL: sum(secmetrics_risk_score)\n\nSatu angka berbobot (critical=100, high=10, medium=3, low=1).\n\nKenapa perlu: '2 critical, 63 high, 80 medium' sulit dibandingkan antar-minggu. Satu angka langsung menjawab 'membaik atau memburuk?'. Angka ini untuk melihat TREN; untuk TINDAKAN tetap pakai breakdown per severity di sebelah kiri.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "secmetrics-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 16, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(secmetrics_risk_score{project=~\"$project\", tool=~\"$tool\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 200 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1000 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Scan terakhir",
      "description": "PromQL: time() - max(secmetrics_scan_timestamp_seconds)\n\nPANEL PALING PENTING DI BARIS INI, meski terlihat paling membosankan.\n\nPushgateway menahan nilai terakhir SELAMANYA. Kalau pipeline scan mati tiga hari lalu, semua angka di atas tetap tampil rapi dan terlihat 'segar' — padahal basi. Dashboard keamanan yang basi lebih berbahaya daripada tidak punya dashboard sama sekali, karena menciptakan rasa aman yang keliru.\n\nPanel ini yang membedakan 'aman' dari 'tidak ada yang memeriksa'.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "secmetrics-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 20, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "time() - max(secmetrics_scan_timestamp_seconds{project=~\"$project\", tool=~\"$tool\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 86400 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 259200 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tren temuan per severity",
      "description": "PromQL: sum by (severity) (secmetrics_vulnerabilities)\n\nINI ALASAN UTAMA MEMAKAI PROMETHEUS, bukan sekadar membaca file JSON.\n\nOutput scanner hanya menjawab 'berapa temuan hari ini'. Deret waktu menjawab pertanyaan yang jauh lebih berguna: 'apakah utang keamanan kita membaik atau memburuk?'.\n\nGaris ini berbentuk tangga (bukan kurva halus) karena angkanya hanya berubah saat scan dijalankan. Setelah otomasi di Milestone 6, setiap commit akan meninggalkan satu titik data — dan lonjakan mendadak langsung terlihat berasal dari perubahan mana.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "secmetrics-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (severity) (secmetrics_vulnerabilities{project=~\"$project\", tool=~\"$tool\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{severity}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]
        },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "pointSize": 5,
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": { "mode": "none", "group": "A" },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "gradientMode": "opacity"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "critical" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "dark-red" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "high" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "medium" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "orange" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "low" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "yellow" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "unknown" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } }]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "piechart",
      "title": "Asal temuan",
      "description": "PromQL: sum by (target_type) (secmetrics_vulnerabilities)\n\nPanel ini menjawab 'siapa yang harus mengerjakan?', bukan sekadar 'berapa banyak'. Setiap jenis punya jalur perbaikan yang berbeda:\n\n  os      -> paket sistem dari base image. Diperbaiki dengan MENGGANTI BASE IMAGE. Satu perubahan kecil sering menghapus ratusan temuan sekaligus.\n  library -> dependency aplikasi. Diperbaiki dengan MENAIKKAN VERSI di requirements.txt, satu per satu, dan berisiko memutus kompatibilitas.\n  code    -> pola berbahaya di kode sendiri (Semgrep). Diperbaiki dengan menulis ulang kodenya; tidak ada versi yang bisa dinaikkan.\n  secret  -> kredensial ter-commit (Gitleaks). Menghapus barisnya TIDAK CUKUP — kredensialnya harus dirotasi, karena sudah dianggap bocor.\n\nEmpat jalur kerja berbeda, sering empat orang berbeda. Angka total tanpa pembedaan ini tidak bisa ditindaklanjuti.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "secmetrics-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (target_type) (secmetrics_vulnerabilities{project=~\"$project\", tool=~\"$tool\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{target_type}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "pieType": "donut",
        "displayLabels": ["percent"],
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "values": ["value", "percent"]
        },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single", "sort": "none" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false } }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Temuan per tool",
      "description": "PromQL: sum by (tool) (secmetrics_vulnerabilities)\n\nTiga tool, tiga sumber risiko yang sama sekali berbeda:\n\n  trivy    -> kerentanan pada paket yang KITA PAKAI (dependency & base image)\n  semgrep  -> pola berbahaya pada kode yang KITA TULIS\n  gitleaks -> kredensial yang tanpa sengaja ikut ter-commit\n\nTidak ada satu pun yang bisa menggantikan yang lain. Dependency sempurna tidak menolong kalau kodenya memanggil eval() pada input user; kode sempurna tidak menolong kalau kunci AWS-nya ada di dalam repo.\n\nPerhatikan juga selisih JUMLAHNYA: Trivy menghasilkan ratusan temuan, Semgrep dan Gitleaks hanya belasan. Itu bukan berarti dua yang terakhir kurang penting — satu private key yang bocor lebih mendesak daripada 100 CVE medium di paket OS. Inilah sebabnya panel severity dan panel 'Secret terekspos' dipisahkan dari angka total.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "secmetrics-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 10, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (tool) (secmetrics_vulnerabilities{project=~\"$project\", tool=~\"$tool\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{tool}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "valueMode": "color",
        "minVizWidth": 8,
        "minVizHeight": 16
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "continuous-BlYlRd" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "blue", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Patch dependency tersedia",
      "description": "PromQL:\n  100 * sum(secmetrics_vulnerabilities_fixable{tool=\"trivy\"})\n       / sum(secmetrics_vulnerabilities{tool=\"trivy\"})\n\nPersentase kerentanan dependency yang sudah tersedia versi perbaikannya dari vendor.\n\nIni metrik pengambilan keputusan, bukan metrik teknis. Backlog 182 temuan terasa mustahil dikerjakan. Tapi kalau 60% di antaranya sudah punya fix, sebagian besar bisa selesai hari ini hanya dengan menaikkan versi — sisanya baru butuh mitigasi. Menggabungkan keduanya dalam satu angka membuat tim menyerah sebelum mulai.\n\nAngka rendah justru sinyal berbeda: banyak kerentanan tanpa patch, yang berarti pilihan base image-nya yang bermasalah.\n\nCATATAN: panel ini SENGAJA dikunci ke tool=trivy dan mengabaikan filter Tool di atas. 'Tersedia patch dari vendor' hanya bermakna untuk kerentanan dependency. Temuan Semgrep dan Gitleaks selalu bisa diperbaiki (tinggal ubah kode / rotasi kredensial), jadi memasukkannya ke pembagian ini hanya akan mengencerkan angkanya tanpa menambah informasi.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "secmetrics-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 7, "x": 10, "y": 13 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "100 * sum(secmetrics_vulnerabilities_fixable{project=~\"$project\", tool=\"trivy\"}) / sum(secmetrics_vulnerabilities{project=~\"$project\", tool=\"trivy\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true,
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 40 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 70 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Secret terekspos",
      "description": "PromQL: sum(secmetrics_vulnerabilities{tool=\"gitleaks\"})\n\nDipisahkan dari angka lain karena sifatnya berbeda secara fundamental.\n\nCVE adalah RISIKO — belum tentu dieksploitasi. Secret yang ter-commit adalah KEBOCORAN yang sudah terjadi. Begitu kredensial masuk ke repo, ia harus dianggap sudah bocor, bahkan bila repo-nya privat: ia tersimpan di riwayat git setiap orang yang pernah clone, di cache CI, dan di backup.\n\nKarena itu 'menghapus barisnya lalu commit' TIDAK menyelesaikan masalah — kredensialnya wajib DIROTASI. Angka ini harus selalu nol; nilai berapa pun di atas nol adalah insiden, bukan backlog.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "secmetrics-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 7, "x": 17, "y": 13 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(secmetrics_vulnerabilities{project=~\"$project\", tool=\"gitleaks\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "dark-red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Temuan paling parah (50 teratas)",
      "description": "PromQL:\n  secmetrics_finding_info\n    * on (project, tool, severity) group_left() secmetrics_severity_weight\n\nKenapa perkalian itu perlu: bagi Prometheus, label 'critical' hanyalah teks — tidak lebih besar dari 'low'. Tabel jadi tidak bisa diurutkan menurut keparahan.\n\nSolusinya vector matching: kalikan metrik detail (yang nilainya selalu 1) dengan metrik bobot severity. Deretnya tetap sama, tapi nilainya kini berupa angka bobot, sehingga bisa diurutkan secara numerik. 'group_left()' menandakan sisi kiri adalah sisi 'banyak' — ada ratusan temuan, tapi hanya lima nilai bobot.\n\nDaftar ini sengaja dibatasi 50 temuan untuk menjaga cardinality Prometheus. Angka agregat di panel lain tetap menghitung SELURUH temuan.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "secmetrics-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "secmetrics_finding_info{project=~\"$project\", tool=~\"$tool\"} * on (project, tool, severity) group_left() secmetrics_severity_weight",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "job": true,
              "component": true,
              "instance": true,
              "environment": true,
              "monitor": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "severity": 0,
              "identifier": 1,
              "package": 2,
              "installed_version": 3,
              "fixed_version": 4,
              "target_type": 5,
              "project": 6,
              "tool": 7,
              "Value": 8
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "severity": "Severity",
              "identifier": "ID",
              "package": "Paket / Lokasi",
              "installed_version": "Versi / Baris",
              "fixed_version": "Ada fix di",
